item ReturFunction qty;shp;pos
⍝ Processes a refund by returning products to stock and updating sales information.
⍝ As a left argument enter 'name'. As a right argument enter quantity.
pos ← ItemName⍳⊂item
shp ← ⍴ItemName

⎕ ←'==================='
⎕←'Kvittorättelse'
⎕←'Espresso House Sweden'
⎕←'===================='
⎕←''
:If pos>shp
⎕← 'Item not found!'
:ElseIf (Sold[pos]-qty)<0
⎕←'Error in number of returned items'
 :Else
 Sold[pos]←Sold[pos]-qty
Svinn ← Svinn+ (0.25×((Price[pos])×qty))
Revenue ← Revenue - (0.25×((Price[pos])×qty))

⎕← 'Item name: ' , ItemName[pos]
⎕← 'Sold items: ' , qty , ' , Price of the item: ', Price[pos]
⎕← ''
⎕← 'Money returned back: ' (qty × Price[pos]), ' SEK'
⎕←'===================='
⎕←''
⎕←'Money will be returned in 2 days'
:EndIf
